# The Monad testnet deployment of 5 October 2026 (chain 10143), as README.md
# lists it. These are public addresses, not secrets. Set them on the hosted
# indexer, or copy this file to .env for a local run, and add ENVIO_API_TOKEN
# (a secret, created at https://app.envio.dev/api-tokens) beside them.

